SOAPBOX: Thanks to K1TTT for hosting me for this contest.This is one contest where I prefer if possible to operate in person. However, Mother Nature had some plans this weekend. I cut short my operating time Sunday morning by 2 or 3 hours so that I could pack up and head home to avoid the storm. I did operate the last hour remotely, but due to weather and football, only made a couple of extra Qs. Friday started slow and it really didn't get too much better. I didn't have many good runs. Missed 4 states (WY, WA, NV, ID) plus AK as well as usually easy CA sections like BC and MB, plus NF, NT, NU, and YT. Eu wasn't loud but workable. With LP, many stations didn't hear me but I heard them. Some stations in zone 20, 14 or 15 were loud, but they just couldn't hear. Thanks for the Qs, maybe see you next month in the phone test.
